$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fdrop1  LOC_AFTER=?

* One iteration of the fragment ` dropNum ` of TM/Prims.lean: the label pops a symbol of the scanned word, the branch on the internal state is true, and the machine returns to the same label with one letter less on the stack.  Lean: ` dropNum_loop ` , the ` cons ` case.

